Stop accepting connections over one of the two ways in.

The configuration is kept, including the key or password, so
turning it back on needs nothing to be re-issued.

Usage:
  olr remote disable wireguard|shadowsocks [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for disable

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")
